Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanDrivingWithOpenRearHatch" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle with open rear hatch" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Open rear hatch of vehicle" .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition ;
    :description "Foggy visibility conditions" .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Open rear hatch obstructing rear visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk due to obstructed rear view" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

